Description: High-throughput extensible toolkit for processing FASTQ data. 
    Builds on Intel TBB’s flow graph to orchestrate concurrent I/O and data
    processing, throughput can be as fast as compression and disk
    speed allows. The package ships with a suite of predefined ‘kernels’ for common FASTQ
    tasks, and its extension system lets you drop in custom kernels so you can
    cover almost any FASTQ processing workflow without giving up performance.
